  "sourceNote": "The Endive record, calendar.sowing_time, gives March–April for both indoor sowing and the extended season. The reviewed Early sowing fact gives the same dates and specifies warmth. At John’s request the existing SOW row shows March and April in the muted sowing colour and May–August in the usual bright colour. Quick facts carry the indoor qualification. The last tip illustrates wet foliage. The usual review groups the longer seasonal facts together and removes the routine pH range from soil preparation."
